 SG_ ChassisValid : 40|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" DASH
 SG_ ChassisSeq : 44|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" DASH
 SG_ BrkLight : 48|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" DASH

