 SG_ MarkSeq : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" DAQ
 SG_ MarkType : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DAQ

BO_ 1699 DAQ_MarkAck: 5 DAQ
 SG_ MarkSeq : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" DASH
 SG_ AckResult : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DASH
