BO_ 1712 WSS_Speed: 8 WSS
 SG_ WssFL : 0|16@1+ (0.01,0) [0|655.34] "km/h" ECU,DAQ,DASH
 SG_ WssFR : 16|16@1+ (0.01,0) [0|655.34] "km/h" ECU,DAQ,DASH
